# Override of ungoogled-chromium-macos/patches/ungoogled-chromium/macos/fix-disabling-safebrowsing.patch,
# rebased for Chromium 153.0.8010.36 (upstream shell still targets 152 as of 2026-09-15).
# WHY: 153 itself removed most safe_browsing deps from static_library("ui") in chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn,
# so that hunk shrinks to deleting the one remaining `//components/safe_browsing/content/browser` line
# (plus `:buildflags` from ui_public_dependencies as before); the chrome/test/BUILD.gn hunk is a
# context-only refresh. The other four file segments are byte-identical to upstream's.
# base-sha256: fa948939054744392880bfedf5208dc9031025667ac4a156a88405cedb56d5dd
#   (SHA-256 of the upstream shell copy this override replaces; install-custom-patches.sh refuses to
#   install over any other content, so an upstream change to this patch forces a re-review.)
# DROP this file once the upstream shell ships an equivalent rebase.
# Fix GN safe_browsing and building with safebrowsing disabled on macOS

